You awake gasping from a nightmare about swarming goblins and blood.
It's a premonition... It must be.
They'll attack at sundown and you need to be prepared.
How will you save this village?
Who can you convince to help?
All you know is, you have 10 hours left.
set {hours} = 10
- Enter village square
label square
[background arg="res://img/point_and_click/backgrounds/village_square.png" fade="0.0"]
What a peaceful place.
if {hours} > 0.0:
	- Yell about the imminent goblin attack | [if {conversation.yell} == false]
		No one seems to believe you. Within a few minutes, they start keeping their distance.
		set {conversation.yell} = true
		jump square
	- Visit the...
		- Blacksmith
			jump blacksmith_timeline/
		- Hunter
			jump hunter_timeline/
		- Doctor
			jump doctor_timeline/
		- Carpenter
			jump carpenter_timeline/
		- Acrobat
			jump acrobat_timeline/
	- Go to the church [forfeit remaining hours]
		[signal arg="res://defense.tscn"]
elif {hours} <= 0.0:
	The sun has started to go down.
	- Go to the church
